    "title": "In-state Athlete McCoy Smith commits to Wisconsin, breaks down decision - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nick Osen ,\n13 hours ago Madison, WI– Waunakee (Wisconsin) 2026 athlete/DL McCoy Smith has achieved a lot for the local Warriors so far, including winning conference Defensive Lineman of the Year, being named all-conference, all-region, and more, all last season before another undefeated regular season this Fall. And as much as Smith has shown to this point, he had picked up some college interests, but none more impactful than a PWO opportunity from Wisconsin, which he earned after Badgers camp this Summer. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
